  <p><p>Haaye ghareeb, haaye ghareeb..(2)<br />
Ya rabb, ya rabb, ya rabb..(2)<br />
ya rabb kisi ghareeb ka aisa safar na ho..(2)<br />
barbaadiyo ke waaste..(2) awaaz gar na ho</p>

<p>1. Tayaara saajo sabke liye umr bhar raha<br />
sehra ko jisne khoon se sayraab kardiya<br />
laasha pada ho dhoop mein..(2) koi shajar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>2. Zakhme sina laga to kaleja ulat gaya<br />
akbar ne apne paalne wale ko di sadaa<br />
baba meri phuphi ko..(2) kahin ye khabar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>3. baba ne jiske haatho pe khaiber utha liya<br />
bhai ne jiske mashk mein darya samo liya<br />
kaandhe pe uske laashaye..(2) noore nazar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>4. Har imtehaan sabr se zainab ne seh liya<br />
lekin dayare shaam mein karti rahi dua<br />
athara bhaiyo ki..(2) behan nange sar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>5. Dada ka ye sharaf ke hai maula e kayenaat<br />
aur baap baat ta raha maqtal mein bhi hayaat<br />
kaano me us yateema ke..(2) haye haye gohar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>6. Karbobala mein, kufe mein, bazaar e shaam mein<br />
be parda sar jhukaye ho darbaar e aam mein<br />
kunba kisi ghareeb ka..(2) yu darr ba darr na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>7. Zainab se sheh ne jab shabe ashoor ye kaha<br />
kal subha tumse hona hai humko bahan juda<br />
wo boli aisi raat ki..(2) ya rabb sahar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>8. Asghar ko dafn karke ye shabbir ne kaha<br />
paani ke badle rann mein lahu tera beh gaya<br />
asghar dua ye kar teri..(2) maa aaj ghar na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>

<p>9. Aati yehi dua hai mere lab pe rozo shab<br />
safdar se khush ho aale nabi aur unka rabb<br />
mazloom se to pyaar ho..(2) zalim ka darr na ho<br />
ya rabb kisi..(2)</p>
